<title>USA: AFTER THE BELL - Not much action in late trading.</title>
<headline>AFTER THE BELL - Not much action in late trading.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>After-hours traders reported little action after the close of regular trading on Friday.</p>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said session one volume was 226,200, compared to Thursday's 408,900. Session two volume was 11,171,394, while on Thursday it was 8,910,905.</p>
<p>	  ((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
</text>
